From df0ba662349ae49d6640298b78a11c6a6596600b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:32:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove all Base44 platform dependencies

- Drop @base44/sdk and @base44/vite-plugin
- Remove base44/ config folder and serverless functions
- Simplify auth to local-first (no login required)
- Replace rain alert function with direct Open-Meteo client call
- Replace account deletion with clear-all-local-data
